- ### Self-describing digests
+ ### Resúmenes autodescriptivos

- A digest's bytes say nothing about the algorithm which produced them. A digest which is stored
- or sent alone can be checked only by something which already knows how it was made. A
- [Multihash](https://multiformats.io/multihash/) prefixes the digest with a code for its
- algorithm and its length, so it describes itself. Content-addressed storage, and the
- distributed protocols built on it, exchange multihashes:
+ Los bytes de un resumen no dicen nada del algoritmo que los produjo. Un resumen que se almacena o
+ se envía solo únicamente puede comprobarlo algo que ya sabe cómo se hizo. Un
+ [Multihash](https://multiformats.io/multihash/) antepone al resumen un código para su algoritmo y
+ su longitud, de modo que se describe a sí mismo. El almacenamiento direccionado por contenido, y
+ los protocolos distribuidos construidos sobre él, intercambian multihashes:

= distributed protocols built on it, exchange multihashes:
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= distributed protocols built on it, exchange multihashes:
